8. Each "To file" item: \`gh issue create --label ai-drafted --label low-priority --title ... --body ...\` (body names the commit). Return them in filed.
9. Remove the phase's worktrees and branches: for each worktree path above, find its branch with \`git worktree list --porcelain\`, then \`git worktree remove --force <path>\` and \`git branch -D <branch>\`.
10. Append one line to ${LOG}: "${DATE} <short sha> ${P.ap} <subject>".
Never push, never touch /Users/kevingalligan/devel/framejob (main), never force-move a branch. Return the short sha.`,
    opts('integrate', { agentType: 'general-purpose', schema: INTEGRATE })))
